    "notes": [
        "Impactor talks to the device through Apple's usbmuxd, which comes with iTunes or the Apple Devices app.",
        "Install one of them first, otherwise the iPhone/iPad will not be found:",
        "  winget install 9NP83LWLPZ9K   (Apple Devices, Microsoft Store)",
        "",
        "Closing the window keeps Impactor running in the tray (for auto-refresh); quit it from the tray icon",
        "before 'scoop update Impactor'.",
        "",
        "Accounts, certificate keys and the refresh list live in %APPDATA%\\PlumeImpactor and are kept on uninstall.",
        "If you turned on start with Windows, uninstall removes that entry."
